Key: dlj_quadratic
Source: Analytic continuous dimensionless jerk for a quadratic speed
        profile v(t)=a t^2: v''=2a => DLJ = (T^3/v_peak^2) INT (2a)^2
        dt = 4 exactly (independent of a,T). Package uses
        forward-difference jerk + rectangle-rule integral =>
        4*(n-2)/(n-1); tol=1e-3 covers the O(1/n)
        finite-difference/quadrature convergence (n=20001, err 5e-5).
Tolerance: 0.001
